rget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"//pix6.agoda.net/agaff/aff.bstatic.com/images/hotel/max500/108/108107843.jpg\" srcset=\"//pix6.agoda.net/agaff/aff.bstatic.com/images/hotel/max500/108/108107843.jpg 1x, //pix6.agoda.net/agaff/aff.bstatic.com/images/hotel/840x460/108/108107843.jpg 2x\" width=\"398\" height=\"598\" /></a></p>\n<h6></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ที่พักริมน้ำจันทบูร , จันทบุรี ( Chanthaburi )</strong> แห่งนี้ได้รับคะแนนรีวิว 9.4/10 จาก Booking.com และ 9.4/10 คะแนนจาก Agoda.com</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">เลือกเข้าพักได้ 1 ท่าน</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ราคา เริ่มต้นห้องละ 450 บาท</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">จองโรงแรม ราคาพิเศษ</span></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=1709429\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1893 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/agodacom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.booking.com/searchresults.th.html?aid=1670294&amp;lang=th&amp;sid=c2ce7081e32bbf94894d48015bba2980&amp;sb=1&amp;src=searchresults&amp;src_elem=sb&amp;error_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.booking.com%2Fsearchresults.th.html%3Faid%3D1670294%3Bsid%3Dc2ce7081e32bbf94894d48015bba2980%3Btmpl%3Dsearchresults%3Bac_click_type%3Db%3Bac_position%3D0%3Bcity%3D-3246999%3Bclass_interval%3D1%3Bdest_id%3D-3246999%3Bdest_type%3Dcity%3Bdtdisc%3D0%3Bfrom_sf%3D1%3Bgroup_adults%3D2%3Bgroup_children%3D0%3Bhighlighted_hotels%3D2246882%3Binac%3D0%3Bindex_postcard%3D0%3Blabel_click%3Dundef%3Bno_rooms%3D1%3Boffset%3D0%3Bpostcard%3D0%3Braw_dest_type%3Dhotel%3Broom1%3DA%252CA%3B